sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant FE as RoguelikePage
    participant API as RoguelikeEndpoints
    participant RS as RoguelikeRunService
    participant MG as RoguelikeMapGenerator
    participant BA as RoguelikeBattleAdapter
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>FE: 冒険の塔を開始
    FE->>API: POST /roguelike/runs
    API->>RS: StartRunAsync(playerId)
    RS->>MG: Generate(seed)
    Note over MG: ノードと parameters_json を生成時に固定\n(Oracle/Encounter/Shop 候補を確定)
    RS->>DB: runs / nodes / edges / members / items INSERT
    API-->>FE: RoguelikeRunSnapshotDto

    loop ノード進行
        U->>FE: ノード選択
        FE->>API: POST /runs/{id}/nodes/{nodeId}/select
        API->>RS: SelectNodeAsync(...)
        RS->>DB: current_node_id, last_activity_at UPDATE

        alt eventType = Battle
            RS->>BA: StartBattle(run, node)
            loop 戦闘ターン
                U->>FE: 行動入力
                FE->>API: POST /runs/{id}/battle/commands
                API->>BA: SubmitCommand(...)
                API->>RS: TouchActivityAsync(...)
                RS->>DB: last_activity_at UPDATE

                FE->>API: POST /runs/{id}/battle/resolve
                API->>BA: ResolveTurn(...)
                alt バトル継続
                    BA-->>API: RoguelikeBattleSnapshotDto
                else バトル終了
                    BA->>RS: RoguelikeBattleResolution
                    RS->>DB: party/run/inventory/event_logs UPDATE
                    API-->>FE: RoguelikeRunSnapshotDto
                end
            end
            alt 主プレイヤーHP=0 or reachableNodeIds=0
                RS->>DB: status=GameOver, ended_at UPDATE
                API-->>FE: 結果ダイアログ表示
            end
            alt _activeBattles が消失
                BA-->>API: 409 BattleStateLost
                API->>RS: AbortRunAsync(...)
                RS->>DB: status=Aborted UPDATE
            end
        else eventType = Oracle/Encounter/Inn/Shop
            FE->>API: イベント操作 API
            API->>RS: Apply event service
            RS->>DB: run/member/item/event_logs, last_activity_at UPDATE
            API-->>FE: RoguelikeRunSnapshotDto
        end
    end

    alt 5F ボス勝利
        RS->>DB: status=Cleared, ended_at UPDATE
    else 手動中断
        FE->>API: POST /runs/{id}/abort
        API->>RS: AbortRunAsync(...)
        RS->>DB: status=Aborted, ended_at UPDATE
    else 30分無活動
        RS->>DB: (HostedService) status=Aborted, ended_at UPDATE
    end
